  <header class="page-hero shell"><p class="section-label">Case study / STRK</p><h1>From discovery<br />to direction<span style="color:#329DB4">.</span></h1><p>A fitness coaching concept evolving through research, positioning, product decisions, and continuing tests.</p></header>
