  <section class="content-section shell"><div class="two-column"><div><p class="eyebrow-number">Concept model / not a shipped screen</p><h2>The coaching loop.</h2></div><div><p>This diagram describes the current proposed experience. Specific behavior, value, and usefulness still need testing with real users and trainers.</p></div></div><div class="flow" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual STRK flow: goals, personalized plan, activity, feedback and adjustment, with optional human trainer support"><div><span>01</span><strong>Goals</strong></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Personalized plan</strong></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Activity</strong></div><div><span>04</span><strong>Feedback &amp; adjustment</strong></div><div><span>Optional</span><strong>Human trainer support</strong></div></div><p class="flow-note">Original explanatory diagram, not a screenshot or claim of released functionality.</p></section>
